---
// 时间与日历小卡片：时钟每秒走动，可切换时区，可展开当月日历，显示下一个节日
import T from './T.astro';

const zones = [
  { value: '', label: '跟随设备时区', en: 'Device time zone' },
  { value: 'Asia/Shanghai', label: '北京时间', en: 'Beijing' },
  { value: 'Asia/Tokyo', label: '东京', en: 'Tokyo' },
  { value: 'Europe/London', label: '伦敦', en: 'London' },
  { value: 'America/New_York', label: '纽约', en: 'New York' },
  { value: 'America/Los_Angeles', label: '洛杉矶', en: 'Los Angeles' },
  { value: 'Australia/Sydney', label: '悉尼', en: 'Sydney' },
];
const weekZh = ['日', '一', '二', '三', '四', '五', '六'];
const weekEn = ['S', 'M', 'T', 'W', 'T', 'F', 'S'];
---

<section class="card clock" data-clock>
  <div class="head">
    <h2 class="card-title">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><path d="M12 7v5l3 2" /></svg>
      <T zh="时间与日历" en="Clock" />
    </h2>
    <button type="button" class="pill" data-cal-toggle aria-expanded="false">
      <span data-cal-label><T zh="日历" en="Calendar" /></span>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="15" rx="2" /><path d="M4 10h16M9 3v4M15 3v4" /></svg>
    </button>
  </div>

  <p class="time" data-time>--:--:--</p>
  <p class="date" data-date>&nbsp;</p>

  <label class="zone">
    <T zh="当前时区" en="Time zone" />
    <select data-zone>
      {zones.map((z) => <option value={z.value} data-zh={z.label} data-en={z.en}>{z.label}</option>)}
    </select>
  </label>

  <div class="calendar" data-calendar hidden>
    <div class="cal-head">
      <button type="button" data-prev aria-label="上个月">‹</button>
      <span data-month></span>
      <button type="button" data-next aria-label="下个月">›</button>
    </div>
    <div class="grid week" aria-hidden="true">
      {weekZh.map((w, i) => <T zh={w} en={weekEn[i]} />)}
    </div>
    <div class="grid days" data-days></div>
  </div>

  <p class="holiday" data-holiday></p>
</section>

<style>
  .head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }
  .head .card-title { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin: 0; }
  .head .card-title svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; color: var(--accent); }
  .pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--accent-strong);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .pill:hover { background: var(--bg); }
  .pill svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }

  .time {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 36px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--accent-strong);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .date { margin: 2px 0 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--title); }

  .zone { display: block; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
  .zone select {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 4px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--card);
    color: var(--text);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .calendar { margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); }
  .cal-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--title); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; }
  .cal-head button {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--accent-strong);
    font-size: 18px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .cal-head button:hover { background: var(--bg); }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr); text-align: center; }
  .week { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  .days :global(span) { padding: 3px 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 24px; }
  .days :global(.today) {
    justify-self: center;
    width: 26px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .holiday { margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
  .holiday :global(b) { color: var(--accent-strong); font-weight: 600; }
</style>

<script>
  const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-clock]');
  if (root) {
    const $ = <T extends HTMLElement>(sel: string) => root.querySelector(sel) as T;
    const timeEl = $('[data-time]');
    const dateEl = $('[data-date]');
    const zoneEl = $<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-zone]');
    const calEl = $('[data-calendar]');
    const toggle = $('[data-cal-toggle]');
    const toggleLabel = $('[data-cal-label]');
    const monthEl = $('[data-month]');
    const daysEl = $('[data-days]');
    const holidayEl = $('[data-holiday]');

    const KEY = 'qingye-clock-zone';
    const WEEK = ['日', '一', '二', '三', '四', '五', '六'];
    const WEEK_EN = ['Sun', 'Mon', 'Tue', 'Wed', 'Thu', 'Fri', 'Sat'];
    const MONTH_EN = ['January', 'February', 'March', 'April', 'May', 'June', 'July', 'August', 'September', 'October', 'November', 'December'];
    const HOLIDAY_EN: Record<string, string> = {
      元旦: "New Year's Day", 春节: 'Spring Festival', 清明节: 'Qingming Festival', 劳动节: 'Labour Day',
      端午节: 'Dragon Boat Festival', 中秋节: 'Mid-Autumn Festival', 国庆节: 'National Day',
    };
    // 中英两份文字，CSS 按当前语言显示其中一份
    const bi = (zh: string, en: string) => `<span class="i18n-zh">${zh}</span><span class="i18n-en" lang="en">${en}</span>`;
    type Day = { y: number; m: number; d: number };

    // 时区下拉框的选项文字跟着语言变
    function updateZoneLabels() {
      const en = document.documentElement.dataset.lang === 'en';
      for (const opt of zoneEl.options) opt.textContent = (en ? opt.dataset.en : opt.dataset.zh) ?? '';
    }
    window.addEventListener('langchange', updateZoneLabels);
    updateZoneLabels();

    let zone = '';
    try { zone = localStorage.getItem(KEY) ?? ''; } catch {}
    zoneEl.value = zone;
    if (zoneEl.value !== zone) zone = zoneEl.value = '';

    // 取某个时区下的年月日时分秒
    function now() {
      const fmt = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US', {
        timeZone: zone || undefined,
        year: 'numeric', month: 'numeric', day: 'numeric',
        hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit', second: '2-digit', hourCycle: 'h23',
      });
      const p: Record<string, string> = {};
      for (const part of fmt.formatToParts(new Date())) p[part.type] = part.value;
      return { y: +p.year, m: +p.month, d: +p.day, time: `${p.hour}:${p.minute}:${p.second}` };
    }

    const utc = (y: number, m: number, d: number) => new Date(Date.UTC(y, m - 1, d));
    const pad = (n: number) => String(n).padStart(2, '0');

    // 春节、端午、中秋的公历日期。浏览器自带农历在个别年份会差一天（如 2027、2030 年春节），
    // 所以这几年用固定日期；表外的年份才用浏览器农历估算
    const LUNAR: Record<number, [string, string, string]> = {
      2026: ['2/17', '6/19', '9/25'],
      2027: ['2/6', '6/9', '9/15'],
      2028: ['1/26', '5/28', '10/3'],
      2029: ['2/13', '6/16', '9/22'],
      2030: ['2/3', '6/5', '9/12'],
      2031: ['1/23', '6/24', '10/1'],
      2032: ['2/11', '6/12', '9/19'],
      2033: ['1/31', '6/1', '9/8'],
      2034: ['2/19', '6/20', '9/27'],
      2035: ['2/8', '6/10', '9/16'],
    };

    // 农历日期（浏览器自带的农历），不支持时返回 null
    let lunarFmt: Intl.DateTimeFormat | null = null;
    try { lunarFmt = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-u-ca-chinese', { timeZone: 'UTC', month: 'numeric', day: 'numeric' }); } catch {}
    function lunar(date: Date) {
      if (!lunarFmt) return null;
      const p: Record<string, string> = {};
      for (const part of lunarFmt.formatToParts(date)) p[part.type] = part.value;
      return `${p.month}/${p.day}`;
    }

    // 清明：每年 4 月 4 日或 5 日（21 世纪通用公式）
    const qingming = (y: number) => Math.floor((y % 100) * 0.2422 + 4.81) - Math.floor((y % 100) / 4);

    function holidayOf(date: Date) {
      const y = date.getUTCFullYear(), m = date.getUTCMonth() + 1, d = date.getUTCDate();
      const md = `${m}/${d}`;
      if (md === '1/1') return '元旦';
      if (md === '5/1') return '劳动节';
      if (md === '10/1') return '国庆节';
      if (m === 4 && d === qingming(y)) return '清明节';
      const fixed = LUNAR[y];
      if (fixed) {
        const i = fixed.indexOf(md);
        return i === -1 ? null : ['春节', '端午节', '中秋节'][i];
      }
      const l = lunar(date);
      if (l === '1/1') return '春节';
      if (l === '5/5') return '端午节';
      if (l === '8/15') return '中秋节';
      return null;
    }

    function renderHoliday(today: Day) {
      const start = utc(today.y, today.m, today.d);
      for (let i = 0; i < 400; i++) {
        const date = new Date(start.getTime() + i * 86400000);
        const name = holidayOf(date);
        if (!name) continue;
        const en = HOLIDAY_EN[name];
        holidayEl.innerHTML = i === 0
          ? bi(`今天是 <b>${name}</b>`, `Today is <b>${en}</b>`)
          : bi(`下一个节日 · <b>${name}</b>（还有 ${i} 天）`, `Next holiday · <b>${en}</b> (in ${i} ${i === 1 ? 'day' : 'days'})`);
        return;
      }
      holidayEl.textContent = '';
    }

    let today: Day = { y: 0, m: 0, d: 0 };
    let view = { y: 0, m: 0 };

    function renderCalendar() {
      monthEl.innerHTML = bi(`${view.y} 年 ${view.m} 月`, `${MONTH_EN[view.m - 1]} ${view.y}`);
      const first = utc(view.y, view.m, 1).getUTCDay();
      const total = utc(view.y, view.m + 1, 0).getUTCDate();
      const cells: string[] = [];
      for (let i = 0; i < first; i++) cells.push('<span></span>');
      for (let d = 1; d <= total; d++) {
        const isToday = view.y === today.y && view.m === today.m && d === today.d;
        cells.push(isToday ? `<span class="today" aria-current="date">${d}</span>` : `<span>${d}</span>`);
      }
      daysEl.innerHTML = cells.join('');
    }

    let timer = 0;
    function tick() {
      const n = now();
      timeEl.textContent = n.time;
      if (n.y !== today.y || n.m !== today.m || n.d !== today.d) {
        today = { y: n.y, m: n.m, d: n.d };
        view = { y: n.y, m: n.m };
        const w = utc(n.y, n.m, n.d).getUTCDay();
        dateEl.innerHTML = bi(`${pad(n.m)}/${pad(n.d)} 星期${WEEK[w]}`, `${WEEK_EN[w]}, ${pad(n.m)}/${pad(n.d)}`);
        renderCalendar();
        renderHoliday(today);
      }
      clearTimeout(timer);
      timer = window.setTimeout(tick, 1000 - (Date.now() % 1000));
    }

    zoneEl.addEventListener('change', () => {
      zone = zoneEl.value;
      try { localStorage.setItem(KEY, zone); } catch {}
      today = { y: 0, m: 0, d: 0 };
      tick();
    });

    toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const open = calEl.hidden;
      calEl.hidden = !open;
      toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
      toggleLabel.innerHTML = open ? bi('收起', 'Hide') : bi('日历', 'Calendar');
      if (open) { view = { y: today.y, m: today.m }; renderCalendar(); }
    });

    const shift = (step: number) => {
      const m = view.m + step;
      view = { y: view.y + Math.floor((m - 1) / 12), m: ((m - 1 + 12) % 12) + 1 };
      renderCalendar();
    };
    $('[data-prev]').addEventListener('click', () => shift(-1));
    $('[data-next]').addEventListener('click', () => shift(1));

    tick();
  }
</script>
